      {
        "type": "text",
        "data": "Treasure hunters, rejoice! Update 1.11, aka the Exploration Update, has now made the treacherous journey from snapshot to full release. Our intrepid developers have scaled mighty crags of code, ventured into untamed pre-release territory and battled bugs to bring you wondrous gaming goodies!",
        "parent": {
          "$ref": 0
        },
        "prev": null,
        "next": null
      },
